# Two-axis orbit
# Two independent clocks move a radial field along a changing path.

:mim 1

:param phaseX number = 0
:vary phaseX from 0 to 31 over 8s loop

# Pingpong reverses without wrapping; the unequal duration delays repetition.
:param phaseY number = 0
:vary phaseY from 0 to 31 over 13s pingpong

:axis x integers
:axis y integers

# Both coordinates evolve, so the animation comes from the program itself.
:field mod((x + phaseX) * (x + phaseX) + (y + phaseY) * (y + phaseY), 31)
:lens value
:color magnitude(lens)
:overlay equality off
